# Raw chain data: ~575k swaps per month, ~30 MB per month across the raw and
# assembled parquets. Too large for the repo, and re-derivable exactly — the
# committed `<month>.blocks.json` records the block range and every eth_getLogs
# chunk, `<month>.meta.json` records the row count and the parquet's sha256, and
# `<month>.anchors.json` records the exact block timestamps the interpolation
# uses. `fetch_months.py` with those files present re-assembles byte-identical
# parquets, and `coverage.py` re-verifies them against chain.
*.parquet
*.log
